THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES
===================

WeAmp.PageSpeed.Sidecar (mod_pagespeed) — the ASP.NET Core nginx sidecar —
redistributes the third-party software listed below. The native package
(WeAmp.PageSpeed.Sidecar.NativeAssets.Linux) physically ships, per Linux runtime
identifier (linux-x64, linux-arm64): a bundled nginx executable, and
ngx_pagespeed_module.so, which statically links the PageSpeed Optimization Library
(PSOL) and its dependencies. This file lists each component, its license, and
copyright holders; full license texts are available at the URLs given.

